<h2>MorphoSource API</h2>

<p>The MorphoSource API, which previously supported HTTP GET search requests for metadata of published resources, is currently down. The API will return shortly with new features, expanded scope, and improved usability.</p>

<p>For current regular users of the API, please contact the <a href='mailto:info@morphosource.org'>admins</a> for an interim solution during this outage period. We can provide access to a previous version of the API for querying the frozen data store from the previous iteration of MorphoSource.</p>